OL,3,AWill it snow this week? Mild Atlantic  
OL,4,Aair collides with cold air across the  
OL,5,AUK                                     
OL,7,FThe UK is in the grip of the coldest   
OL,8,Fspell of autumn so far.                
OL,10,FYellow cold health alerts from the UK  
OL,11,FHealth Security Agency remain in force 
OL,12,Funtil 09:00 GMT on Tuesday, warning of 
OL,13,Fpossible impacts to health services and
OL,14,Fvulnerable people.                     
OL,16,FThe cold Arctic air is clashing with   
OL,17,Fmild Atlantic air that arrived in the  
OL,18,Fsouth-west of the UK over the weekend -
OL,19,Fa meteorological setup that provides   
OL,20,Fthe ingredients for possible snow.     
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
